      "content": "for programmatic management \nof TB preventive treatment \nWhen preparing a budget for PMTPT, the following considerations need to be made given that these \nare major cost determinants:\n•\t Estimated burden\n\t– Populations of each target group (PLHIV, contacts, clinical risk groups, other risk groups)\n\t– Number of households and other sites (health facilities, ARV centres) to be covered for expansion \nof TPT activities\n•\t Investigation of target populations\n\t– Test for TB infection (TST/IGRA) as per national policy (such as test equipment general supplies, \nprocurement fees for supplies, specimen",
